# Git LFS tracking for gamedevtc.github.io
#
# GitHub Pages does NOT resolve Git LFS pointers -- it serves the pointer text file,
# not the media. So anything the live site loads (banner, gallery videos/gifs) must
# stay a normal git blob and must NOT be listed here.
#
# Convention: archival media too large to serve (>50 MiB) lives under a stored/ folder,
# is removed from the slides.json galleries, and is tracked by LFS below. Files in
# stored/ are never requested by the site, so LFS pointers there are harmless.
**/stored/*.mp4  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
**/stored/*.mov  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
**/stored/*.webm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
